{"title":"Garage Door","slug":"Garage_Door","pageid":2981,"revid":21653,"timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:19:48Z","lastEditor":"WhiteEagle17","categories":["Structures"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater Island"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Illumine Designs"},{"label":"Price","value":"$3,200"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"?"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"Up. Down. Up. Down. Useful for hiding away your vechiles!\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The garage door is a door which can be purchased at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Illumine_Designs/\">Illumine Designs</a> for $3,200. Once placed it can be resized from 4x4x1 to 50x50x1 studs. It can be toggled open and closed by pressing E. It can also be opened through <span data-unresolved=\"1\">logic</span> with an <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Interactor/\">interactor</a>. The logic number 5 and above will open it and every logic input below 5 will close them. \n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>The door has a frame around all sides except the bottom.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The largest possible garage door\">The largest possible garage door</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The largest possible garage door. </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The smallest possible garage door\">The smallest possible garage door</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The smallest possible garage door\">The smallest possible garage door</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The smallest possible garage door. </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
